  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder and avgpool aggregation (config_005) achieve the highest accuracy so far (0.6501). This experiment tests adding a strong image encoder (imagenet_vit_l) to the multimodal setting while retaining the proven RNA encoder and aggregation method. It isolates the impact of the image encoder's quality, which could potentially boost performance without complicating other factors. This balances exploration of multimodal benefits with leveraging established effective components."
